      "description": "Crispy golden seasoned fries in small, medium, and large. Included with every Chicken Strip Basket and the $7 Meal Deal. The most ordered side on the DQ menu.",
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "price": "2.49",
        "priceCurrency": "USD",
        "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock",
