---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Regular Fries — Price, Calories 2026" description="DQ Regular Fries price: from $2.49, 260+ calories. Crispy seasoned fries in small, medium, and large. Included with Chicken Strip Baskets and $7 Meal Deal.">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(itemSchema)} />


<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb"><div class="container"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/#full-menu">Menu</a></li><li><a href="/categories/snacks-sides">Snacks &amp; Sides</a></li><li><span aria-current="page">Regular Fries</span></li></ol></div></nav>

<div class="container">
  <div class="item-hero">
    <div class="item-media">
      <img src="/Images/regular-fries.webp" alt="DQ Regular Fries — Dairy Queen 2026 menu item" width="600" height="450" loading="eager">
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="badge-row"><span class="badge red">Lightly Seasoned</span><span class="badge">Included in Meal Deals</span><span class="badge blue">Available in 3 Sizes</span></div>
      <h1>DQ Regular Fries</h1>
      <div class="item-price-lg">From $2.49</div>
      <p>The universal savory anchor across Dairy Queen's hot kitchen, DQ Regular Fries feature skin-on, straight-cut Idaho potatoes fried golden-crisp with fluffy steamy interiors, tossed lightly in fine sea salt. Served hot in Small ($2.49), Medium ($2.99), and Large ($3.49), and included automatically with every Chicken Strip Basket and $7 Meal Deal.</p>

      <table class="spec-table"><tbody><tr><td>Starting Price</td><td>$2.49 (small)</td></tr><tr><td>Calories (Small)</td><td>260 cal</td></tr><tr><td>Sizes</td><td>Small · Medium · Large</td></tr><tr><td>Included With</td><td>Chicken Strip Basket, $7 Meal Deal</td></tr><tr><td>Also In</td><td>2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match (eligible item)</td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Price &amp; Calories by Size — 2026</h2>
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Size / Option</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Total Fat</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Small Fries</strong></td><td>$2.49</td><td class="price-cell">260 cal</td><td>12g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Medium Fries</strong></td><td>$2.99</td><td class="price-cell">370 cal</td><td>17g</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Large Fries</strong></td><td>$3.49</td><td class="price-cell">480 cal</td><td>23g</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:10px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);">Prices are 2026 national averages. Your local DQ may vary slightly.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>Dairy Queen French Fries: The Crisp Golden Complement</h2>
    <p>While many visitors associate Dairy Queen primarily with soft serve and ice cream cakes, the brand's hot food operations serve millions of pounds of golden potatoes each year. <strong>DQ Regular French Fries</strong> utilize a straight-cut profile engineered for maximum exterior surface crispness while retaining a light, baked-potato fluffiness inside. Lightly seasoned with fine salt, they are engineered to dip easily into DQ's warm country white gravy, spicy queso, or honey mustard sauces. Explore the complete savory side menu on <a href="/categories/snacks-sides">Snacks &amp; Sides</a> or compare meal options on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

    <h2>The Bundle Economics: How to Get Fries for Free or Discounted</h2>
    <p>While ordering à la carte is convenient ($2.49 for Small, $3.49 for Large), seasoned DQ diners rarely pay full price for fries thanks to multiple meal deal integrations:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Chicken Strip Baskets:</strong> Every 4-piece ($9.99) and 6-piece ($13.49) basket includes a full portion of Regular Fries, buttery Texas toast, and dipping sauce at zero extra charge.</li>
      <li><strong>The $7 Meal Deal:</strong> Regular Fries serve as one of the four mandatory pillars alongside an <a href="/items/original-cheeseburger">Original Cheeseburger</a> or 3-pc tenders, a soft drink, and a sundae.</li>
      <li><strong>2-for-$5 Mix &amp; Match:</strong> Allows pairing a regular fry order with a hot dog or cheeseburger for an effective cost of only $2.50.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Side-by-Side: Fries vs. Other Premium DQ Sides</h2>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
      <thead><tr><th>Side Option</th><th>Starting Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Best Dipping Pairing</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><strong>Regular Fries</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td><td>260 cal (Small)</td><td>Country white gravy or signature DQ ketchup</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/onion-rings">Onion Rings</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.89</td><td>400 cal</td><td>Creamy ranch or honey mustard</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/cheese-curds">Cheese Curds</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>470 cal</td><td>Marinara or warm queso dip</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/pretzel-sticks-queso">Pretzel Sticks</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>440 cal</td><td>Zesty cheddar jalapeño queso</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/side-salad">Side Salad</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.29</td><td>90 cal</td><td>Light Italian or balsamic vinaigrette</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>

    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list"><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much are DQ Regular Fries?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Small $2.49 (260 cal), Medium $2.99 (370 cal), Large $3.49 (480 cal). 2026 national average prices.</div></div>
      </div><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Are DQ fries included with the Chicken Strip Basket?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. Regular Fries are included with all Chicken Strip Basket options — 4-piece, 6-piece, and all sauced versions — at no extra charge.</div></div>
      </div><div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Can I substitute fries in the $7 Meal Deal?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
        <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">The $7 Meal Deal includes Regular Fries as a standard component. Substitution options vary by location.</div></div>
      </div></div>

