      <li><a href="/items/pretzel-sticks-queso">Soft Pretzel Sticks with Zesty Queso — $3.99</a></li>
      <li><a href="/categories/snacks-sides">All Dairy Queen Snacks &amp; Sides</a></li>
    </ul>
